  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d1mY0f51/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13fabric.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<h1><strong>進階下界合金 (Fabric)</strong></h1>\n<p><em>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>！</em></p>\n<p>這是 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本，請點擊 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 查看 Forge / NeoForge 版本。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📖 關於</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>Advanced Netherite</strong> 是一款兼容原版且開源的模組，為您帶來更多等級的下界合金！\n本模組的目標是透過新增更多達成目標，來延伸原版的 Minecraft 體驗。</p>\n<p>如需更多資訊，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite 維基</a>！</p>\n<p>感謝 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a> 製作全新且改進的貼圖！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>✅ 功能特色</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTdvpvZ2/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11fabric.png\" alt=\"Features\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>4 種<strong>全新</strong>等級的下界合金！</li>\n<li>每種新的下界合金等級都包含對應的工具組、盔甲組與方塊</li>\n<li>每個下界合金等級都有獨特的屬性（特殊的盔甲加成、工具額外掉落）</li>\n<li>支援擴充套件與數據包</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💎 下界合金等級</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"Tiers\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>請查閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite 維基</a> 以查看所有合成配方，或安裝配方查看模組。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔖 熱門版本連結</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>ℹ 更多資訊</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>請將問題回報至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 的問題追蹤頁面</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以將您的模組收錄在我的整合包中嗎？絕對可以！</li>\n<li>在此查看 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 與 NeoForge 版本</a>！</li>\n<li>點擊 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 查看更多截圖！</li>\n<li>前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite 維基</a> 了解本模組新增的所有內容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</strong></h3>\n<p><em>若您想在新更新發布、獲得模組支援等資訊時收到通知，請<a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 伺服器</a>！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"Break\"></p>\n<h4><strong>⚠️ 免責聲明</strong></h4>\n<p>本模組僅透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetheriteFabric/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 儲存庫</a> 進行散發。\n請勿重新散佈此模組 <em>或</em> 從其他下載來源下載此模組。</p>\n<p>有關模組盜版轉載的更多詳情及防護方法，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
